\begin{corollar}
	Given $n=3$ assume $\Int(\Delta) \cap M \nsubseteq \textrm{plane}$. Then
\[  \ker(\Phi_{f \vert{Im \, \kappa_f}}) = \{ 0  \},  \]
We say that $Y_f$ fulfills the ITT for $\mathcal{X} \rightarrow B$.  
